    s__SURVEY_ADVICE(py_str("Yes, have one done - the lender's valuation is not a survey, and it only tells the lender the house is worth what it is lending. A RICS level 2 homebuyer report is about £400 to £700 and a level 3 building survey £600 to £1,500, which is the one for an old or unusual house; level 1 is around £300 to £500 and is the basics only. Read the report for the things it says to get checked by a specialist, and get quotes for those before you exchange, because that is when you can still renegotiate."));
