    s_CREDIT_SCORE_GOOD(py_str("There is no one good number, because the three agencies score on different scales: Experian runs from 0 to 999 and puts roughly 881 to 960 in its good band, Equifax scores out of 1,000 and TransUnion out of 710. What a lender weighs is the report behind the number - payments on time, card balances under about 30% of the limit and no run of new applications - so the band matters less than those three."));
